# React & UI

## Structure

- Pages: `src/pages/`; sections: `src/sections/`; shared UI: `src/components/ui/`
- Routes: `src/app/router.jsx`
- Prefer existing `PageHero`, `Section`, `Container`, `Heading`, `Text`, `Button`

## Patterns

- Match neighboring file style (CSS modules vs shared classes)
- Keep visible `<h1>` on marketing pages (avoid sr-only-only titles when a real hero exists)
- Forms: shared validation in `src/lib/contactValidation.js`; submit via `submitContactForm`
- Honeypots: obscure names (`mfTrap`), never `name="website"`

## Motion

- Respect reduced motion providers; do not add noisy motion
- Reuse existing hooks (`useFadeUp`, `useInView`, etc.) before inventing new ones

## Performance

- Prefer lazy routes already in the router
- Do not add `useMemo`/`useCallback` by default unless the file already uses them heavily
